## Configuration

Copy `.env.example` to `.env` and adjust:

- `DATABASE_URL` — defaults to a local sqlite file; use a Postgres URL
  (e.g. a Neon branch) for anything real.
- `JWT_SECRET` — set this in production; without it the service mints a
  random secret on every boot (tokens stop working across restarts).
